  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-11-01T23:10:43.056Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It would be cool if:\n\nGiving the rank system avatars a better take.\n\nFor example, the closer a person will get to you, the more features will be allowed.\n\nExample: A trusted user comes closer to you and every 15 meters it shows more and more features from the avatar safety settings.\n\nAnd if a new user comes closer to you, then it only opens the visitor features and then the new user's avatar features.\n\nIt will not only be way more optimized and good, but it will also reduce the crashing problem. Because if someone for example a trusted user that has all the features on, because the player selected everything for trusted user in the shield level, he will not get crashed until he comes closer to the crasher.\n\nAnd when a person is like, 75 meter away from you, make them be an imposter. You won't really care how their avatar looks like 75 meter away from you. I'll tell you more, even if the person turns into an imposter in 50 meters, you won't really care much. You can't see the details of the avatar in 25 meters that much. So it won't really make a huge difference on the looks of the avatar if they will turn into an imposter in 75 meter away from you.",
